      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 · Inbound Meta\nSubscribe your Page to the **leadgen** webhook field and point it at `/webhook/roofradar/meta`\n(GET = verification using `settings.meta.verify_token`, POST = lead events).\nThe payload only carries a `leadgen_id`; we fetch the real lead from the Graph API with *our* token,\nso a forged webhook cannot inject data. Set `settings.meta.sms_consent_in_form=true` only if your\nform includes an SMS consent disclaimer.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 260
      },
